Z||000014||Kasdan||09-02-2001||11:21 AM||||No, i dont hink songman is a hipocryte.  We all post things that may see to contredict other things we've said.  give the guy a break!<P>------------------<BR>Tyler Morgan<BR>1986 GT Fastback, <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FIERO2.JPG">       <BR>Holley Ram-Air, Power Steering, K&N Filtercharger, Bosch Wires, Bosch Platinum Plugs, Conrad Distribuiter Cap/Rotor, New GT Seats, New Headliner, New Carpet, Ocelet Exhaust, Red Underbody Light Kit (coming soon)<BR>Aim=FieroDriver1986||||reg||1
Z||000015||JSocha||09-02-2001||12:09 PM||||&lt;Pulls out his voting TOKEN, looks at it and throws it into the SONGMAN pot&gt;<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>NOPE</B></FONT><P>I do not think anyone here really could be deemed a hypocrite anymore then LZ, roger, aus, cliff, ken, mach, v8fiero, edsb, myself, etc. would or could be.<P>Music blasting is 100x different from the exhaust sound of a Harley.  Music in my opinion being blasted until the glass on the car vibrates has no purpose.  Harley's loud exhaust, its there.  Its not like it has a volume control (unless of course you muffle).  But they are known to be loud to begin with and most people accept it with some minor irritation.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||6
