Z||000033||Songman||09-02-2001||10:17 PM||||LZ, I accept your apology and offer mine for my part... That is what keeps this forum together. The ability to disagree and not have to kill each other for it.. heheh<P>And Formula, you asked specifically if I ran straight pipes so this is not an attempt to keep anything going... No, I do not. I replaced my factory tips with slant cuts which are still mufflers and just slightly <BR>louder than factory...<P>Now let's get the girls in here and turn the music up so we can dance... the first round is on LZ! hehe<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||6
